SUMMARY:The Neon Room at Helium: Hannah Jones
LOCATION:Portland
DESCRIPTION:Hannah is a stand up comedian based in Brooklyn\, New York. Aft
 er being homeschooled in a conservative\, religious co-op\, her irreverent 
 takes on sex\, dating\, and gender politics are as original as they are dee
 ply uncomfortable for her mother to hear. She is a regular Woman About The 
 Internet\, and her videos on Tiktok and Instagram have been viewed over 40 
 million times\, where she is consistently "shitting on the mother toilet"\,
  as they say. She has been featured on Netflix Is a Joke Radio and Don't Te
 ll Secret Sets. Her comedy has been written about in Denverite and Westword
 \, and covered on Channel 7 News. She has been invited to open for Josh Gon
 delman\, Atsuko Okatsuka\, Todd Barry\, and Kumail Nanjiani. She is also a 
 regular at the Denver Comedy Works\, where she has hosted for juggernauts i
 ncluding Ari Shaffir\, Dave Attell\, and Aziz Ansari.\n\nManagement reserve
 s the right to prevent customers from entering the facility who they deem d
 isruptive or dangerous to other patrons.\nMore info: https://comedyatlas.ap
 p/comedy-atlas/event/the-neon-room-at-helium-hannah-jones/
